sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Mobile
    participant Backend
    participant RabbitMQ
    participant Worker as Python Worker
    participant S3
    participant Claude as Claude Haiku

    Note over User,Claude: Quiz Generation & Attempt Flow

    User->>Mobile: Tap "Quiz Me" on note
    Mobile->>Backend: POST /notes/{noteId}/quizzes
    Backend->>Backend: Create Quiz (PENDING)
    Backend->>RabbitMQ: Publish QuizGenerationEvent
    Backend-->>Mobile: 202 QuizSummary (PENDING)

    Mobile->>Mobile: Show "Generating quiz..."

    RabbitMQ->>Worker: Consume from quiz.generation.queue
    Worker->>S3: Fetch note body by S3 key
    S3-->>Worker: Raw note text
    Worker->>Worker: Compute question count (3/5/7/10)
    Worker->>Claude: Generate MCQ questions (JSON)
    Claude-->>Worker: Questions array
    Worker->>RabbitMQ: Publish QuizGenerationResult (READY)
    RabbitMQ->>Backend: Consume from quiz.generation.result.queue
    Backend->>Backend: Save QuizQuestions, set status=READY

    loop Poll every 2s (max 30 attempts)
        Mobile->>Backend: GET /quizzes/{quizId}
        Backend-->>Mobile: QuizResponse (status)
    end

    Mobile->>Mobile: Show "Starting quiz..."
    Mobile->>Backend: POST /quizzes/{quizId}/attempts
    Backend-->>Mobile: AttemptStartResponse (questions, no answers)

    User->>Mobile: Answer questions, navigate, submit
    Mobile->>Backend: PUT /quizzes/{quizId}/attempts/{attemptId}
    Backend->>Backend: Grade answers, compute score
    Backend-->>Mobile: AttemptResultResponse (score, correct answers, explanations)

    Mobile->>Mobile: Show results screen

    Note over User,Mobile: Save to Study Bridge

    User->>Mobile: Tap "Save to Study"
    Mobile->>Mobile: Show dialog (All / Missed only)
    User->>Mobile: Choose option
    Mobile->>Mobile: SaveToStudyUseCase converts QuestionResults to FlashCards
    Mobile->>Mobile: Insert into local SQLite (FlashCardEntity)
    Mobile->>Mobile: Snackbar "X cards saved to Study"

    Note over User,Mobile: Study Tab (Local Only)

    User->>Mobile: Open Study tab
    Mobile->>Mobile: Load due FlashCards from SQLite
    User->>Mobile: Review cards (SM-2 spaced repetition)
    Mobile->>Mobile: Update ease_factor, interval, next_review_at
